[statement]
A `!` entry places the package carrying its name before the package stating
it, though the entry does not admit that package's version: `x` 2.0 comes
before `app`, whose `!x>5` it is.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:!x>5

P:x
V:2.0

[request]
app
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install x 2.0
install app 1
